{"seq":2,"slug":"inventory-optimization","title":"库存优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/warehouse-and-fulfillment/inventory-optimization","wordCount":1282,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"库存优化\">库存优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>库存优化是在服务水平（不缺货）和库存成本（资金占用+仓储费）之间寻找最优平衡点的运筹学问题。电商的库存优化复杂度远高于传统零售——SKU 数量以百万计、需求波动大、补货频率高。库存过多导致资金占用和滞销风险，库存不足导致缺货损失和用户流失。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[需求预测] --&gt; B[安全库存计算]&#10;    B --&gt; C[补货点设定]&#10;    C --&gt; D{库存水平检查}&#10;    D --&gt;|低于补货点| E[触发补货]&#10;    D --&gt;|高于补货点| F[继续监控]&#10;    E --&gt; G[采购/调拨]&#10;    G --&gt; H[入库补充]&#10;    H --&gt; D&#10;    I[库存分析] --&gt; J[ABC分类]&#10;    J --&gt; B&#10;    K[促销计划] --&gt; A\">graph TB\n    A[需求预测] --&gt; B[安全库存计算]\n    B --&gt; C[补货点设定]\n    C --&gt; D{库存水平检查}\n    D --&gt;|低于补货点| E[触发补货]\n    D --&gt;|高于补货点| F[继续监控]\n    E --&gt; G[采购/调拨]\n    G --&gt; H[入库补充]\n    H --&gt; D\n    I[库存分析] --&gt; J[ABC分类]\n    J --&gt; B\n    K[促销计划] --&gt; A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库存指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>行业基准</th>\n<th>优化方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>库存周转率</td>\n<td>年销售成本/平均库存</td>\n<td>6-12次</td>\n<td>越高越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存天数</td>\n<td>365/库存周转率</td>\n<td>30-60天</td>\n<td>越低越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺货率</td>\n<td>缺货SKU数/总SKU数</td>\n<td>&lt;3%</td>\n<td>越低越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务水平</td>\n<td>满足需求的比例</td>\n<td>95-99%</td>\n<td>越高越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存准确率</td>\n<td>系统库存=实际库存</td>\n<td>&gt;99.5%</td>\n<td>越高越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滞销率</td>\n<td>90天无动销SKU占比</td>\n<td>&lt;10%</td>\n<td>越低越好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"abc-xyz-分类管理\">ABC-XYZ 分类管理</h2><p>ABC 分类按销售贡献度将商品分为三类：A 类（前 20% SKU，贡献 80% 销售额）、B 类（中间 30%，贡献 15%）、C 类（后 50%，贡献 5%）。XYZ 分类按需求稳定性分：X（波动小，可预测）、Y（中等波动）、Z（高波动，难预测）。</p>\n<p>ABC-XYZ 交叉分类产生 9 种组合，每种组合对应不同的库存策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类</th>\n<th>需求特征</th>\n<th>库存策略</th>\n<th>补货方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AX</td>\n<td>高贡献、稳定</td>\n<td>精细管控、低安全库存</td>\n<td>自动补货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AY</td>\n<td>高贡献、中波动</td>\n<td>中等安全库存</td>\n<td>定期检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AZ</td>\n<td>高贡献、高波动</td>\n<td>高安全库存、弹性采购</td>\n<td>按需采购</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BX</td>\n<td>中贡献、稳定</td>\n<td>标准管控</td>\n<td>自动补货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BY</td>\n<td>中贡献、中波动</td>\n<td>标准安全库存</td>\n<td>定期检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BZ</td>\n<td>中贡献、高波动</td>\n<td>较高安全库存</td>\n<td>混合策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CX</td>\n<td>低贡献、稳定</td>\n<td>简化管控</td>\n<td>批量补货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CY</td>\n<td>低贡献、中波动</td>\n<td>最小库存</td>\n<td>按需补货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CZ</td>\n<td>低贡献、高波动</td>\n<td>考虑淘汰</td>\n<td>代发/Dropship</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface InventoryClassification {&#10;  sku: string;&#10;  abcClass: &#39;A&#39; | &#39;B&#39; | &#39;C&#39;;&#10;  xyzClass: &#39;X&#39; | &#39;Y&#39; | &#39;Z&#39;;&#10;  metrics: {&#10;    annualRevenue: number;&#10;    revenueShare: number;&#10;    demandCoV: number;&#10;    averageDailyDemand: number;&#10;    leadTime: number;&#10;  };&#10;  policy: {&#10;    safetyStockDays: number;&#10;    reorderPoint: number;&#10;    maxStock: number;&#10;    reviewCycle: &#39;continuous&#39; | &#39;daily&#39; | &#39;weekly&#39;;&#10;    replenishmentMethod: &#39;auto&#39; | &#39;manual&#39; | &#39;mixed&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InventoryClassification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  abcClass</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'A'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'B'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'C'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  xyzClass</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'X'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Y'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Z'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    annualRevenue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    revenueShare</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    demandCoV</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    averageDailyDemand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    leadTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  policy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    safetyStockDays</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    reorderPoint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maxStock</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    reviewCycle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'continuous'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'daily'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'weekly'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    replenishmentMethod</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'auto'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'manual'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mixed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"安全库存与补货算法\">安全库存与补货算法</h2><p>安全库存（Safety Stock）是为应对需求波动和供应不确定性而额外持有的缓冲库存。安全库存的计算需要平衡两个成本：缺货成本（失去订单+用户流失）和持有成本（资金占用+仓储）。</p>\n<p>经典的安全库存公式为：SS = Z × σ_d × √L，其中 Z 是服务水平对应的标准正态分位数（95% 对应 Z=1.65），σ_d 是日需求标准差，L 是补货提前期天数。但这个公式假设需求正态分布，实际电商中长尾 SKU 的需求往往呈泊松分布或间歇分布，需要使用更精确的方法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SafetyStockCalculation {&#10;  method: &#39;normal&#39; | &#39;poisson&#39; | &#39;simulation&#39; | &#39;machine_learning&#39;;&#10;  inputs: {&#10;    averageDailyDemand: number;&#10;    demandStdDev: number;&#10;    leadTimeDays: number;&#10;    leadTimeVariability: number;&#10;    targetServiceLevel: number;&#10;  };&#10;  result: {&#10;    safetyStock: number;&#10;    reorderPoint: number;&#10;    economicOrderQuantity: number;&#10;    annualHoldingCost: number;&#10;    expectedStockouts: number;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ReplenishmentPolicy {&#10;  type: &#39;reorder_point&#39; | &#39;periodic_review&#39; | &#39;min_max&#39; | &#39;kanban&#39;;&#10;  parameters: {&#10;    reorderPoint?: number;&#10;    reorderQuantity?: number;&#10;    reviewPeriod?: number;&#10;    minLevel?: number;&#10;    maxLevel?: number;&#10;  };&#10;  constraints: {&#10;    minimumOrderQuantity: number;&#10;    orderMultiple: number;&#10;    supplierLeadTime: number;&#10;    maxStorageCapacity: number;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SafetyStockCalculation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'normal'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'poisson'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'simulation'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'machine_learning'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  inputs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    averageDailyDemand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    demandStdDev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    leadTimeDays</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    leadTimeVariability</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    targetServiceLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    safetyStock</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shi